Digitalisation of process- Contractor safety assessment: During the year, your Company further strengthened its safety management framework through the implementation of a digitalised contractor safety assessment process on 17th October 2025. The initiative introduces a structured, transparent, and data-driven approach to evaluate contractor safety performance through quarterly digital assessments based on standardised parameters such as compliance with safety procedures, supervision quality, PPE usage, and incident tracking. This digital transformation has enhanced accountability, improved transparency, and enabled faster, evidence-based decision-making, including contract evaluation and targeted corrective actions.
